Walking under the autumn leaves along the Kamogawa river, looking north towards the Sanjo Ohashi bridge. Kodak Ektar 100 film gives it a vintage look.
</p>
<p class="jp">
鴨川沿いの紅葉の下を歩きながら、北の三条大橋方面を望む。  ヴィンテージ感を出すために、フィルムはKodak Ektar 100を使用。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Kyoto" /><category term="Kamo River" /><category term="Foliage" /><category term="Film" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Walking under the autumn leaves along the Kamogawa river, looking north towards the Sanjo Ohashi bridge. Kodak Ektar 100 film gives it a vintage look. 鴨川沿いの紅葉の下を歩きながら、北の三条大橋方面を望む。 ヴィンテージ感を出すために、フィルムはKodak Ektar 100を使用。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_A7R08564-positive_edit.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_A7R08564-positive_edit.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Maple Leaf Day・もみじの日</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261127/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Maple Leaf Day・もみじの日" /><published>2026-11-27T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-27T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/maple-leaf</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261127/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
