Many boats ply the Oi River in Arashiyama, as visitors take in the colorful autumn foliage on both banks.
</p>
<p class="jp">
嵐山の大堰川には多くの船が浮かび、観光客たちは両岸に広がる色鮮やかな紅葉を楽しんでいる。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Arashiyama" /><category term="Katsura River" /><category term="Foliage" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Many boats ply the Oi River in Arashiyama, as visitors take in the colorful autumn foliage on both banks. 嵐山の大堰川には多くの船が浮かび、観光客たちは両岸に広がる色鮮やかな紅葉を楽しんでいる。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_DSC_2835_edit.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_DSC_2835_edit.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Joju-ji Temple・浄住寺</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261125/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Joju-ji Temple・浄住寺" /><published>2026-11-25T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-25T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/joju-ji</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261125/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
The sun came out just long enough to illuminate the maple trees at the entrance to Joju-ji temple in western Kyoto.
</p>
<p class="jp">
京都西部の浄住寺。入り口のもみじを照らすのに足るだけの間、太陽が顔をのぞかせた。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Kyoto" /><category term="Temples" /><category term="Foliage" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[The sun came out just long enough to illuminate the maple trees at the entrance to Joju-ji temple in western Kyoto. 京都西部の浄住寺。入り口のもみじを照らすのに足るだけの間、太陽が顔をのぞかせた。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101728_edit.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101728_edit.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Along the Oi River・大堰川沿い</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261124/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Along the Oi River・大堰川沿い" /><published>2026-11-24T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-24T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/oigawa</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261124/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Walking along Arashiyama's Oi River, last week. The morning sun illuminates a tree along the calm river.  <br/>🎞️ Kodak Ektar 100 film.
</p>
<p class="jp">
先週、嵐山の大堰川沿いを歩いた。朝日が、穏やかな川辺の木を照らしている。

</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Arashiyama" /><category term="Katsura River" /><category term="Film" /><category term="Foliage" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Walking along Arashiyama's Oi River, last week. The morning sun illuminates a tree along the calm river. 🎞️ Kodak Ektar 100 film. 先週、嵐山の大堰川沿いを歩いた。朝日が、穏やかな川辺の木を照らしている。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_A7R08534-positive_edit-2.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_A7R08534-positive_edit-2.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Stone Garden・石庭</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261123/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Stone Garden・石庭" /><published>2026-11-23T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-23T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/ryoanji</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261123/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Ryoan-ji temple's stone garden in the morning, still in shade. The maple trees outside the garden add a splash of color to the scene.
</p>
<p class="jp">
朝、まだ日陰にある龍安寺の石庭。塀の向こうのモミジの木々が、景色に彩りを添えている。

</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Kyoto" /><category term="Temples" /><category term="Foliage" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Ryoan-ji temple's stone garden in the morning, still in shade. The maple trees outside the garden add a splash of color to the scene. 朝、まだ日陰にある龍安寺の石庭。塀の向こうのモミジの木々が、景色に彩りを添えている。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101619-Pano.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101619-Pano.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Jojakko-ji temple・常寂光寺</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261122/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Jojakko-ji temple・常寂光寺" /><published>2026-11-22T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-22T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/jojakkoji</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261122/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Colorful leaves along a staircase catch the morning sunlight.
</p>
<p class="jp">
石段沿いの紅葉が、朝の日差しを浴びている。

</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Arashiyama" /><category term="Temples" /><category term="Foliage" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Colorful leaves along a staircase catch the morning sunlight. 石段沿いの紅葉が、朝の日差しを浴びている。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101548_edit.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101548_edit.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Komyoji Temple・光明寺</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261121/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Komyoji Temple・光明寺" /><published>2026-11-21T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-21T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/komyoji</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261121/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Hanging maple leaves in front of the main hall (Mie Do) of Komyoji temple, in the southwest part of Kyoto.
</p>
<p class="jp">
京都府長岡京市にある光明寺の御影堂の前で、紅葉したカエデの枝を垂らしている。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Kyoto" /><category term="Temples" /><category term="Gardens" /><category term="Foliage" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Hanging maple leaves in front of the main hall (Mie Do) of Komyoji temple, in the southwest part of Kyoto. 京都府長岡京市にある光明寺の御影堂の前で、紅葉したカエデの枝を垂らしている。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101456_edit.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_RX101456_edit.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Enkoji Temple・圓光寺</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261120/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Enkoji Temple・圓光寺" /><published>2026-11-20T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-20T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/enkoji</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261120/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Late morning sun illuminates the Jyugyu no Niwa garden at this northern Kyoto temple, ablaze in autumn color.
</p>
<p class="jp">
午前も遅い時間の陽射しが、洛北のこの寺にある「十牛之庭」を照らし出し、庭は燃えるような紅葉に染まっている。
</p>

