</div>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Kyoto" /><category term="Temples" /><category term="Gardens" /><category term="Foliage" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Late morning sun illuminates the Jyugyu no Niwa garden at this northern Kyoto temple, ablaze in autumn color. 午前も遅い時間の陽射しが、洛北のこの寺にある「十牛之庭」を照らし出し、庭は燃えるような紅葉に染まっている。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_A7R08448_edit.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2611_A7R08448_edit.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Kuwayama Jinja・鍬山神社</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261119/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Kuwayama Jinja・鍬山神社" /><published>2026-11-19T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2026-11-19T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/kuwayama-jinja</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/261119/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
